定价、拥挤度很高，均值回归的风险在积累。（口径：基于未来20日已实现收益的RankIC，读数比盘面滞后约20个交易日，仅描述环境，不构成投资建议。）", "caveat": "以上由因子IC统计自动推导，未做行业/市值中性化、未计费用与涨跌停约束，仅作市场环境识别，不构成投资建议；重要结论请先用「数据校验」页抽样核对。"}, "factors": [{"code": "mom_20", "name": "动量Momentum(20日)", "category": "price_volume", "category_name": "价量类", "desc": "近20日复权收益率，越高代表过去20日涨得越多", "has_data": true, "stats_h": {"1": {"ic_mean": -0.0366, "ic_std": 0.1704, "icir": -0.215, "win_rate": 0.416, "t_stat": -3.4, "ic_gt_002": 0.908, "recent_mean": -0.076, "n_obs": 250, "first_date": "2025-08-29", "last_date": "2026-09-09", "wow": {"win": 5, "cur": -0.0501, "prev": -0.0889, "delta": 0.0388, "noise95": 0.2229, "beyond": false, "n_block": 83}, "mom": {"win": 21, "cur": -0.0948, "prev": -0.0214, "delta": -0.0734, "noise95": 0.076, "beyond": false, "n_block": 20}}, "5": {"ic_mean": -0.0455, "ic_std": 0.1703, "icir": -0.267, "win_rate": 0.404, "t_stat": -4.22, "ic_gt_002": 0.912, "recent_mean": -0.1193, "n_obs": 250, "first_date": "2025-08-25", "last_date": "2026-09-03", "wow": {"win": 5, "cur": -0.0465, "prev": -0.2987, "delta": 0.2522, "noise95": 0.2789, "beyond": false, "n_block": 82}, "mom": {"win": 21, "cur": -0.2181, "prev": -0.0128, "delta": -0.2054, "noise95": 0.1608, "beyond": true, "n_block": 20}}, "20": {"ic_mean": -0.0624, "ic_std": 0.1639, "icir": -0.381, "win_rate": 0.388, "t_stat": -6.02, "ic_gt_002": 0.896, "recent_mean": -0.2689, "n_obs": 250, "first_date": "2025-08-04", "last_date": "2026-08-13", "wow": {"win": 5, "cur": -0.18, "prev": -0.3982, "delta": 0.2182, "noise95": 0.228, "beyond": false, "n_block": 79}, "mom": {"win": 21, "cur": -0.2672, "prev": -0.0696, "delta": -0.1976, "noise95": 0.2572, "beyond": false, "n_block": 19}}}, "last_ic": -0.075, "last_ic_h": {"1": {"ic": -0.075, "d": "2026-09-09"}, "5": {"ic": 0.0311, "d": "2026-09-03"}, "20": {"ic": -0.0166, "d": "2026-08-13"}}}, {"code": "rev_5", "name": "短期反转(5日)", "category": "price_volume", "category_name": "价量类", "desc": "近5日收益取负，A股经典的短期反转效应", "has_data": true, "stats_h": {"1